{
  "uid": "tracing-red",
  "title": "ecommerce-msa Tracing RED (span_metrics)",
  "description": "OTel Collector 의 span_metrics 커넥터가 추적에서 만든 RED 지표 — OpenTelemetry 데모의 Spanmetrics 대시보드를 따랐다(docs/63).",
  "tags": [
    "tracing",
    "opentelemetry"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "서비스",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(traces_span_metrics_calls_total, service_name)",
          "refId": "svc"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(traces_span_metrics_calls_total, service_name)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Jaeger (Explore)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22jaeger%22%7D",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "요청률 (req/s) — 서버 스팬",
      "description": "추적에서 뽑은 호출 수(span_metrics). Collector 가 꼬리 샘플링 **전**의 스팬 전부로 센다 — Jaeger 에 남는 추적 수와 달리 실제 호출 수다.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "오류율 — 서버 스팬",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) / sum by (service_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 지연 (ms) — 점을 누르면 그 추적(Jaeger)",
      "description": "exemplar(점)는 그 구간의 실제 요청 하나다. 누르면 Jaeger 에서 그 추적이 열린다(docs/63).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_bucket{span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Kafka 발행 · 소비 (spans/s)",
      "description": "아웃박스 발행(PRODUCER)과 리스너(CONSUMER). 한쪽만 있으면 추적 헤더가 끊긴 것이다(docs/63 §3).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service_name, span_kind, span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{span_kind=~\"SPAN_KIND_(PRODUCER|CONSUMER)\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} {{span_kind}} {{span_name}}",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "느린 오퍼레이션 상위 15 (p95 ms, 지난 1시간)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Value",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "topk(15, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service_name, span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\"}[1h]))))"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
